> I am a relative newbie, and am just getting to the stage where nymphs are a 
> real problem. I am playing Valks. What is the best way to kill em?

Nymphs are particularly good at sneaking up on you in dark corridors,
so if there's one awake on the current level and you want to kill it
before it takes any more of your stuff, get a light source or the
infravision intrinsic, or just stay the hell away from dark corridors.
They'll come to you eventually (hopefully before you starve, anyway.)

Oh, and carrying lots of useless junk (not so much that it burdens you
though) reduces the chance of a nymph actually stealing anything
useful.

